<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual receipts 100,000 head. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded $1.00 to $1.50 higher than the mid-session Monday. Top $51.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>				Country		  Plant</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs		 49.00 -50.00	   50.00 -51.00</p>
<p>few			   48.50  50.50	   49.50  51.50</p>
<p>Sows - steady/up $1.00. Top $51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs.    40.00 -42.00	   40.00 -43.00</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs.    43.00 -45.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>	  500 lbs. up     46.00 -49.00	   47.00 -51.00</p>
